OL,3,GNEWSARural on-demand bus service to
OL,4,Aexpand
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore residents will gain access to a
OL,7,Frural on-demand bus later this month.
OL,9,FIn July, Westmorland and Furness
OL,10,FCouncil launched a bus in Ulverston
OL,11,Fthat could be booked in advance over
OL,12,Fthe phone or online. The local
OL,13,Fauthority said the bus had carried out
OL,14,F367 journeys in its first month of
OL,15,Foperation.
OL,17,FThe service will now expand to Penrith
OL,18,Ffrom 14 September. Liberal Democrat
OL,19,Fcouncillor Adrian Waite said the bus
OL,20,Fhad the potential to be
OL,21,F"transformational" for rural
OL,22,Fcommunities.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
